---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
---

<Page title="About" description="About this research notebook.">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="about-header">
      <span class="eyebrow">About</span>
      <h1 class="about-title">The notebook</h1>
    </header>

    <div class="prose about-body">
      <p>
        This is a public research notebook. I use it to think through companies,
        industries, and books — and to publish that thinking in a form I'd want
        to read myself.
      </p>

      <p>
        The research section is where I work through business models: unit
        economics, competitive dynamics, capital allocation. The book memos are
        reactions, not summaries — what stuck, what I'd argue with, and how my
        thinking shifted.
      </p>

      <h2>Why public?</h2>
      <p>
        Writing forces precision. Publishing forces honesty. And occasionally
        someone reads it, disagrees, and makes the thinking better. That's the
        deal.
      </p>

      <h2>Based in Austin</h2>
      <p>
        Reach me at <a href="mailto:hello@example.com">hello@example.com</a>.
        I'm always interested in talking about companies, books, or anything in
        the overlap.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Page>

<style>
  .about-header {
    padding: var(--space-12) 0 var(--space-8);
  }

  .about-header .eyebrow { display: block; margin-bottom: var(--space-4); }

  .about-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: var(--size-2xl);
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
  }

  .about-body {
    padding-bottom: var(--space-16);
  }
</style>
